        {
          "text": "Syũa yaku yĩtikathũa ĩngĩ, o na mwei waku ndũkakw’a; nũndũ Yeova akeethĩwa kyeni kyaku tene na tene, na mĩthenya ya kũmeta kwaku ĩkeethĩwa ĩ mĩthelu. ",
